[{"answer":"Hello?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Hi, Susie, it's Paul here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/2.mp3"},{"answer":"How are you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Enjoying your new job?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/4.mp3"},{"answer":"You're working at the library, aren't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/6.mp3"},{"answer":"I started when the library re-opened a month ago.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/7.mp3"},{"answer":"It's great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually Carol and I have been meaning to join for a while.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, you should.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/10.mp3"},{"answer":"It doesn't cost anything,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/11.mp3"},{"answer":"and the new library has all sorts of facilities.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/12.mp3"},{"answer":"It's not just a place where you borrow books.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/13.mp3"},{"answer":"For instance, there's an area with comfortable seats where you can sit and read the magazines they have there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Some people spend the whole morning there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Wish I had that amount of time to spend!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, you must be pretty busy at present, with the children and everything?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/17.mp3"},{"answer":"We are, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/18.mp3"},{"answer":"But we're hoping to get away this summer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/19.mp3"},{"answer":"We're thinking of going to Greece.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we've got a much larger section of the library devoted to travel books now,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/21.mp3"},{"answer":"so you should come and have a look.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I can't remember if there's anything specifically on Greece,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/23.mp3"},{"answer":"but I should think so.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/24.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Now Carol's organising a project for the history class she teaches at school,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/26.mp3"},{"answer":"it's about life in the town a hundred years ago.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you have anything that might be useful?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, actually we've now got a new section with materials on the history of the town and surrounding region.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. I'll tell her.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/30.mp3"},{"answer":"You can't always find that sort of thing on the internet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Now in the old library there used to be a separate room with reference books.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/32.mp3"},{"answer":"It was a really nice quiet room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. We've put those books in the main part of the library now,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/34.mp3"},{"answer":"but we do have a room called the community room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/35.mp3"},{"answer":"It can be hired out for meetings,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/36.mp3"},{"answer":"but at other times people can use it to study.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/37.mp3"},{"answer":"I might use that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/38.mp3"},{"answer":"It's hard to find anywhere quiet at home sometimes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/39.mp3"},{"answer":"I can't remember how old your son and daughter are...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/40.mp3"},{"answer":"we've introduced a special section of fiction written specially for teenagers,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/41.mp3"},{"answer":"but they might be a bit young for that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, they would be.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we do have lots of activities for younger children.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/45.mp3"},{"answer":"For example we have a Science Club.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/46.mp3"},{"answer":"At the next meeting, they're going to be doing experiments with stuff that everyone has in the kitchen -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/47.mp3"},{"answer":"sugar and flour and so on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/48.mp3"},{"answer":"They might be interested, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/49.mp3"},{"answer":"And we have a competition for children called Reading Challenge.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/50.mp3"},{"answer":"That doesn't begin until after the end of term.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/51.mp3"},{"answer":"They have to read six books,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/52.mp3"},{"answer":"and they get a certificate if they manage it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/53.mp3"},{"answer":"So that gives them something to do while they're on holiday, instead of getting bored.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/54.mp3"},{"answer":"That's the idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/55.mp3"},{"answer":"And there's special activities for adults too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/56.mp3"},{"answer":"On Friday we have a local author called Tanya Streep,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/57.mp3"},{"answer":"who's going to be talking about her new novel.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/58.mp3"},{"answer":"It's called 'Catch the Mouse'","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/59.mp3"},{"answer":"and she based the story on a crime that actually took place here years ago.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/61.mp3"},{"answer":"We're not free on Friday, but I'll look out for the book.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Now this probably isn't for you,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/63.mp3"},{"answer":"but we do have IT support available for members.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/64.mp3"},{"answer":"We get quite a few older people coming along","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/65.mp3"},{"answer":"who are wanting to get up to speed with computer technology.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/66.mp3"},{"answer":"It's on Tuesday mornings -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/67.mp3"},{"answer":"they don't need to make an appointment or anything, they just turn up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, my mother might be interested,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/69.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll let her know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/70.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/71.mp3"},{"answer":"And there's another service which you wouldn't expect from a library,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/72.mp3"},{"answer":"which is a free medical check-up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/73.mp3"},{"answer":"The hospital arranges for someone to come along","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/74.mp3"},{"answer":"and measure the level of sugar in your blood,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/75.mp3"},{"answer":"and they check cholesterol levels at the same time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Really?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, but that's only for the over-60s,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/78.mp3"},{"answer":"so you wouldn't qualify.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/79.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'll tell my mother, she might be interested.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/81.mp3"},{"answer":"What other information...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/82.mp3"},{"answer":"well, we do have a little shop with things like wallcharts and greetings cards,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/83.mp3"},{"answer":"and also stamps so you can post the cards straightaway, which is really useful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/84.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/85.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'll bring the children round at the weekend and we'll join.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/86.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, one more thing - I'll be bringing the car, is there parking available?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/87.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, and it's free in the evening and at weekends.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/88.mp3"},{"answer":"Perfect.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/89.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, thanks, Susie...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-1-2023-05-22-08-12-27/90.mp3"}]
